=========================================

STATUS: DRAFT — REQUIRES QUALIFIED INDIAN SOFTWARE LICENSING LAWYER REVIEW
BEFORE ADOPTION OR RELIANCE. This document is a repository draft for policy
transition planning. It does not constitute legal advice.

IMPORTANT LEGACY RIGHTS PRESERVATION
------------------------------------
This draft does NOT revoke, withdraw, limit, or retroactively modify any rights
that were already granted to any person under the prior
"NEURAL AURORA SOURCE-AVAILABLE LICENSE" dated 2026, as preserved in
`LICENSE.LEGACY-2026-SOURCE-AVAILABLE.md`.

If you previously received rights under that legacy license (including, where
applicable, verified Contributor or Verified Student rights), those previously
granted rights remain preserved to the extent they were validly granted. Any
new proprietary/commercial restrictions in this draft are intended to apply
prospectively to copies, versions, releases, and uses not already covered by
those preserved legacy rights, subject to final legal review.

This file does not make the public repository private. Public visibility of
source code does not grant permission to use it beyond the applicable license.

